                                "sense_id": "d5db9ddc-ae8c-3bf8-b2d5-cad981a2ce1d",
                                "text": "In workshops extraordinary scenes would unfold, for example the superfat Apple Hard turned a cartwheel, […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6b3ec743-2601-470e-a040-3b44350dc06d",
                                "sense_id": "d5db9ddc-ae8c-3bf8-b2d5-cad981a2ce1d",
                                "text": "But at bashes, as one of many fat and superfat women in the room, if I want attention—sexual or otherwise—I work harder to get it."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c2b1ad8b-bca2-40d5-bda9-4b3b6653c2e8",
                                "sense_id": "d5db9ddc-ae8c-3bf8-b2d5-cad981a2ce1d",
                                "text": "If you are a midsize (think size 22-24) to superfat (size 26-32), you by all accounts are the type of fat no one wants to be."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
